.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH tine-version 1  "version " 
.SH NAME
tine\-version \- Print the Tine version and exit
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBtine version\fR [\fB\-\-debug\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print the Tine version and exit
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-debug\fR
Enable diagnostic logging for the desktop app
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
